{"h":11508,"page":221,"lines":[{"w":0.65900109030983667,"text":"\"All her people groan as they search for bread;","y":0.93346003091484264,"h":0.028973348557002954,"x":0.13010794131062689,"conf":1},{"x":0.14964371373892513,"w":0.46318287044376516,"y":0.91715116339709735,"h":0.0203488365052239,"text":"they trade their treasures for food","conf":1},{"x":0.14726841838542473,"text":"to revive their strength.","conf":1,"y":0.89236111153299158,"w":0.33016625936929278,"h":0.021883074253324475},{"w":0.39324262544706268,"text":"Look, O Lord, and behold,","y":0.8654255189603699,"x":0.14422285277932365,"h":0.02863964580354228,"conf":1},{"h":0.020458425794328994,"text":"for I am despised.'","conf":1,"x":0.14726840929525498,"y":0.84883720948479113,"w":0.26128266074440692},{"conf":1,"x":0.14726841842262775,"w":0.58669830916763899,"h":0.024801587301587324,"text":"'Is it nothing to you, all you who pass by?","y":0.8226686511988387},{"y":0.8066860462839357,"text":"Look and see","x":0.14964370560464074,"w":0.18289786499816102,"conf":1,"h":0.015988372621082103},{"h":0.02414967332567497,"text":"if there is any sorrow like my sorrow","y":0.77700812768471939,"x":0.14459597322679918,"w":0.50642652635450491,"conf":1},{"w":0.40773939157461198,"text":"which was brought upon me,","x":0.14663819088159141,"h":0.027750174204508427,"y":0.75344255718742104,"conf":1},{"text":"which the Lord inflicted","x":0.14707068257896672,"y":0.73674049162688149,"w":0.3353613568590833,"h":0.019525535522945336,"conf":1},{"x":0.14489312415016367,"w":0.61045128958565853,"conf":1,"y":0.70930232551961159,"h":0.023336563791547471,"text":"on the day of his fierce anger.' \" (1: 11, 12.)"},{"y":0.68750000025111135,"conf":1,"x":0.12826603745206769,"h":0.021825396825396748,"text":"\"In the dust of the streets","w":0.35629453287496193},{"conf":1,"y":0.65988372077154955,"x":0.1425178183570639,"w":0.36817102308397165,"h":0.023255813689458948,"text":"lie the young and the old;"},{"h":0.021888842658391194,"conf":1,"text":"my maidens and my young men","x":0.14251782951421482,"y":0.63808139531833508,"w":0.44655579405945617},{"text":"have fallen by the sword;","conf":1,"y":0.61627907028199791,"h":0.021865770930335704,"w":0.35154392192890116,"x":0.14489311783602457},{"h":0.026313576433393715,"y":0.59004099499464191,"x":0.1421923952380609,"w":0.62293753685889308,"text":"in the day of thy anger thou hast slain them,","conf":1},{"text":"slaughtering without mercy.\" (2: 21.)","conf":1,"x":0.14251782912304084,"w":0.5201900036304028,"y":0.57118055558200276,"h":0.020389211556268161},{"h":0.024638641448248011,"conf":1,"y":0.54239586904564785,"text":"\"The tongue of the nursing cleaves","x":0.12548175116075536,"w":0.49474567561954652},{"y":0.52168833006857529,"w":0.46627995874974637,"h":0.023788640423426544,"x":0.14221712360327954,"conf":1,"text":"to the roof of its mouth for thirst;"},{"text":"the children beg for food,","conf":1,"x":0.14251781769541744,"y":0.49702380990207484,"w":0.35391923978731232,"h":0.023325026981414365},{"text":"but no one gives to them.\" (4: 4.)","w":0.46555818830217632,"y":0.47668650818703462,"conf":1,"x":0.14489311802230842,"h":0.021860003471374512},{"y":0.44607501399088834,"h":0.025311206068311498,"w":0.71830813915698566,"x":0.12303547874665459,"text":"\"Our inheritance has been turned over to strangers,","conf":1},{"y":0.42720839430707191,"x":0.14224172535968582,"w":0.28100771718210987,"h":0.019784454315427746,"conf":1,"text":"our homes to aliens."},{"w":0.50868081427239753,"x":0.14233177525488575,"y":0.40059190090667141,"text":"We have become orphans, fatherless;","conf":1,"h":0.0239044636014909},{"w":0.40422308290159548,"h":0.019711901271153964,"conf":1,"text":"our mothers are like widows.","y":0.38216162719734081,"x":0.13998586272755789},{"h":0.021871539335402201,"text":"We must pay for the water we drink,","conf":1,"y":0.35610465139270531,"x":0.14251781094158109,"w":0.5130641491382153},{"conf":1,"text":"the wood we get must be bought.","y":0.33430232572994623,"w":0.46318287044376527,"x":0.14014253530068266,"h":0.020360372369251589},{"conf":1,"y":0.31250000014855084,"h":0.020348836505223789,"text":"With a yoke on our necks we are hard driven;","x":0.14014252043782732,"w":0.63895485617897729},{"conf":1,"x":0.14014251046110776,"y":0.28918650796637824,"w":0.62945368382837863,"h":0.020406514879256932,"text":"we are weary, we are given no rest.\" (5: 2-5.)"},{"conf":1,"w":0.78622327532087055,"h":0.021842700148385741,"y":0.25868055564156411,"x":0.10688835514241517,"text":"It is this very God of fierce anger and mercilessness whom"},{"conf":1,"y":0.23536706315052525,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.021900378522418773,"x":0.073634232141229411,"text":"the poet praises as the God whose mercies and faithfulness"},{"y":0.21354166700520305,"x":0.073634205640528916,"conf":1,"text":"are renewed every morning! What gives him the strength to","h":0.021923449304368736,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"text":"do so, or the justification to do so? Is not his confidence","h":0.025991125712319096,"y":0.18989804976376445,"x":0.073421145171802885,"w":0.81985310145786827,"conf":1},{"y":0.16860465157296944,"conf":1,"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"perhaps a matter of artistry or of neurotic self-deception? He","h":0.020383444097306969,"x":0.071258933174483632},{"x":0.071258933174483632,"text":"sees all the pain and suffering of the present in the light of a","y":0.14533730175545345,"conf":1,"h":0.020360372369251589,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"y":0.12351190449587401,"h":0.021836932689424549,"text":"great hope. The ground of his hope is: \"The Lord is my","x":0.071258913912500388},{"x":0.071258917934964208,"conf":1,"text":"portion,\" says my soul: \"therefore will I hope in Him.\"","w":0.77434678511186084,"h":0.021894610117352165,"y":0.10019841305389598},{"h":0.015988372621082103,"conf":1,"y":0.07412790655283108,"text":"225","w":0.057007126993947221,"x":0.45130641327262261}],"w":7029}